# Tree view
Tree View presents hierarchical data such as files or project structure. By default, activating a branch toggles it and only leaf items are selectable. Arrow keys navigate visible items; Right expands or enters a branch, Left collapses or returns to its parent, and Home/End move to the boundaries.
<DocsExample title="Tree view" {source} {htmlSource}><Example /></DocsExample>

Use `size="sm"` for a denser tree in sidebars and file explorers without changing its selection or navigation behavior.
<DocsExample title="Small tree view" source={smallSource} htmlSource={smallHtmlSource}><SmallExample /></DocsExample>
